  "description": "Erection of a second floor rear extension with a mansard roof. Installation of new fencing on the first floor terrace and new doors on the rear ground floor.",
  "epc_number": "8401-5725-4429-3526-4813",
  "ward": "Chiswick Homefields",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-19T14:40:16.690Z",
  "street_name": "Netheravon Road",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - 1.\tThe proposed second floor rear extension, by reason of its height, scale and siting adjacent to the shared boundary with No. 5 Netheravon Road, would result in an unacceptable loss of outlook, increased sense of enclosure and potential loss of daylight to the occupiers of the adjoining property. In the absence of sufficient information to demonstrate that the neighbouring window does not serve a habitable room, cannot be satisfied that the proposal would not cause unacceptable harm to neighbouring living conditions. The proposal is contrary to Council's Residential Extension Guidelines, Policies CC1, CC2 and SC7 of the Hounslow Local Plan and the NPPF. ",
    "Reason : 2 - 2.\tThe proposed second floor rear extension, because of its design, size and scale, would create a dominant, bulky and visually intrusive addition that would fail to appear subordinate to the host dwelling, and unbalance the pair of semi-detached houses, against the prevailing pattern of development along the street, harming the character and appearance of the host dwelling and the surrounding area. The proposal is contrary to Council's Residential Extension Guidelines, Policies SC7, CC1 and CC2 of the Hounslow Local Plan and the NPPF."
  ],
